{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.mikoto.magazine",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她抱着篮子，杂志堆到篮口",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mikoto.magazine",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mikoto.magazine",
    "idolId": "mikoto",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "──啊，对了，制作人。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯？怎么了。",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "之后有点时间吗？有地方想让你陪我去。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "可以啊。今天也没有别的安排了。",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "太好了。那样的话──……",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "美琴，要买什么？篮子我来拎吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……我打算买挺多的，可能会很重。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "就算这样……也可以吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哦，那更要拎了！",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "真的？那，就拜托你了。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，交给我！",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "──啊……有了。这本杂志，还有……这个也要。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "…………还有，这个不错。过刊也还在。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "制作人，那边水蓝色和……粉色封面的杂志也帮我拿一下？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？啊……这些吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……嗯。好，杂志差不多就这些。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……除了杂志，还要买别的吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……？嗯，还有很多。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "我说了吧？会买挺多的。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，那是听到了……",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "CD 那层还没逛，动漫区也还得去。",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "篮子重的话，还是我来拿？",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，没关系……不是那个意思。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "买这么多的话，网购送到家不是更轻松吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "………………",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "以前试过一次，结果快递箱一下就满了。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "我要练习，在家的时候很少，根本收不到，就不弄了。",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……这样啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那以后在事务所收也没关系哦。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……诶，可以吗？嗯……这样啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "那很感谢……不过，不用了。",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "我想像这样在店里，一个一个找、亲手拿起来。",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "这本杂志内页的女孩，还有那部剧里的女演员。",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "以前大家都一起想当偶像……大多数人，都走上了别的路。",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……看到现在的活动变成这样排在那里──……",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "………………",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……这样啊，原来如此。",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我还想你买的杂志种类真杂……原来是这么回事。",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "…………うん，是这样。",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "────啊……",
        "nextNodeId": "44"
      },
      "44": {
        "id": "44",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "…………『特集、斑鳩ルカ』──……",
        "nextNodeId": "45"
      },
      "45": {
        "id": "45",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "制作人，这个也……放进篮子里？",
        "nextNodeId": "46"
      },
      "46": {
        "id": "46",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "──啊，美琴。",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "随时都可以陪你。",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "下次再来吧。",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          },
          {
            "label": "下次就轮到美琴了。",
            "nextNodeId": "140"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "美琴有想要的东西时，随时跟我说。",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……谢谢。",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "抱歉，让制作人干拎东西这种事。",
        "nextNodeId": "103"
      },
      "103": {
        "id": "103",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈……没关系。",
        "nextNodeId": "104"
      },
      "104": {
        "id": "104",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "而且总觉得，又稍微多了解了美琴一点，挺高兴的。",
        "nextNodeId": "105"
      },
      "105": {
        "id": "105",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "…………！",
        "nextNodeId": "106"
      },
      "106": {
        "id": "106",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好了，CD 层和动漫区也要去吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "107"
      },
      "107": {
        "id": "107",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……うん。"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "在美琴想买的东西装满篮子之前。",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……是啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "杂志也好 CD 也好，现在什么都能用数据弄到手。",
        "nextNodeId": "123"
      },
      "123": {
        "id": "123",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "像这样来店里、真的用手拿起来，对美琴来说──",
        "nextNodeId": "124"
      },
      "124": {
        "id": "124",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "不，对我来说也是很好的刺激。",
        "nextNodeId": "125"
      },
      "125": {
        "id": "125",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "…………うん。谢谢，制作人。"
      },
      "140": {
        "id": "140",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "诶……？",
        "nextNodeId": "141"
      },
      "141": {
        "id": "141",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "像这样登在杂志上、我们的 CD 摆出来。",
        "nextNodeId": "142"
      },
      "142": {
        "id": "142",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "之后演唱会的影像也会发售，写真集之类的也会出吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "143"
      },
      "143": {
        "id": "143",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "现在的活动一点点积累……我想早点看到它变成形状排在那里。",
        "nextNodeId": "144"
      },
      "144": {
        "id": "144",
        "speakerId": "mikoto",
        "text": "……うん。到那时候，还能再陪我一起来吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "145"
      },
      "145": {
        "id": "145",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "哈哈……嗯。",
        "nextNodeId": "146"
      },
      "146": {
        "id": "146",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "当然，我就是这么打算的。"
      }
    }
  },
